40
00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:14.987
Ms. Lily shows the class some 3D shapes. A dice is a cube and a ball is a sphere. A can of juice is a cylinder. The pyramids in Egypt have a square bottom. Malis counts the edges on the cube: twelve!

